            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鼠标只上报按钮编号，不会提供位置。完成标注后，重新打开应用也能显示正确位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect only the mouse you are setting up. Mouse input cannot yet be separated by device.": {
