            "value": "Touch gesture မသိမ်းရသေးပါ။ အကြံပြု gesture တွေကို ကြည့်ပါ၊ ဒါမှမဟုတ် အပေါ်မှာ action တစ်ခု သတ်မှတ်ပါ။"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未保存触控手势。可以查看建议手势，或在上方设置操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch feel": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touch feel"
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ထိတွေ့မှု ချိန်ညှိရန်"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触控手感"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before your first test": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before your first test"
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ပထမဆုံး မစမ်းခင်"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次试用前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If a double tap also triggers macOS Smart Zoom, turn Smart Zoom off in System Settings → Mouse → More Gestures. Pause other mouse utilities while testing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If a double tap also triggers macOS Smart Zoom, turn Smart Zoom off in System Settings → Mouse → More Gestures. Pause other mouse utilities while testing."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "နှစ်ချက်ထိလိုက်လို့ macOS Smart Zoom ပါ ဖြစ်လာရင် System Settings → Mouse ထဲမှာ Smart Zoom ကို ပိတ်ပါ။ စမ်းနေတုန်း တခြား mouse app တွေကိုလည်း ခေတ္တပိတ်ထားပါ။"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果轻点两次还触发了 macOS 智能缩放，请在系统设置 → 鼠标中关闭智能缩放。测试时暂停其他鼠标工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start with tap and right-side tap, then try swipes, pinch, drag and drag scrolling. The examples are illustrations; real Magic Mouse testing is still required.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start with tap and right-side tap, then try swipes, pinch, drag and drag scrolling. The examples are illustrations; real Magic Mouse testing is still required."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "တစ်ချက်ထိတာနဲ့ ညာဘက်ခြမ်းထိတာကို အရင်စမ်းပါ။ ပြီးမှ swipe၊ pinch၊ drag နဲ့ drag လုပ်ရင်း scroll တာကို စမ်းပါ။ နမူနာတွေက ရှင်းပြတဲ့ပုံတွေပါ။ Magic Mouse အစစ်နဲ့ စမ်းဖို့ ကျန်ပါသေးတယ်။"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先试轻点和右侧轻点，再试滑动、捏合、拖动和拖动时滚动。示例仅用于演示，仍需要用真实 Magic Mouse 验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change one setting at a time. Larger movement thresholds reduce accidental gestures.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change one setting at a time. Larger movement thresholds reduce accidental gestures."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ဆက်တင်တစ်ခုစီ ပြောင်းပြီး စမ်းပါ။ ရွှေ့ရမယ့် အကွာအဝေးကို တိုးထားရင် မတော်တဆ gesture ဖြစ်တာ လျော့ပါမယ်။"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次只调整一项。增大移动距离阈值可以减少误触。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long a touch can last and still count as a tap.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How long a touch can last and still count as a tap."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "တစ်ချက်ထိတာလို့ သတ်မှတ်ဖို့ လက်ချောင်းကို အများဆုံး ဘယ်လောက်ကြာ ထားနိုင်မလဲ။"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触摸持续多久以内仍算作轻点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time allowed between taps. Increase if you double-tap slowly.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Time allowed between taps. Increase if you double-tap slowly."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "နှစ်ချက်ထိတဲ့အခါ အကြားမှာ ခွင့်ပြုမယ့်အချိန်ပါ။ ဖြည်းဖြည်းနှိပ်တတ်ရင် တိုးထားပါ။"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两次轻点之间允许的间隔。如果轻点较慢，可以调大。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far your finger can move during a tap. Lower values reject more accidental touches.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How far your finger can move during a tap. Lower values reject more accidental touches."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "တစ်ချက်ထိနေတုန်း လက်ချောင်း ဘယ်လောက်ရွှေ့နိုင်မလဲ။ လျှော့ထားရင် မတော်တဆ ရွှေ့ထိတာကို ပိုစစ်ထုတ်ပါမယ်။"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点时允许手指移动的距离。调小后会过滤更多误触。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap slide speed": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap slide speed"
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
