    "Time to hold the second touch before dragging starts. Moving that finger also starts a drag. Mouse button holds are unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Time to hold the second touch before dragging starts. Moving that finger also starts a drag. Mouse button holds are unchanged."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ဒုတိယအကြိမ်ထိတဲ့အခါ drag စဖို့ ဖိထားရမယ့်အချိန်ပါ။ လက်ချောင်းကို ရွှေ့လိုက်ရင်လည်း drag စပါမယ်။ Mouse ခလုတ် ဖိထားတဲ့ဆက်တင်ကို မပြောင်းပါဘူး။"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第二次触摸按住多久后开始拖动。移动该手指也会开始拖动，不影响鼠标按键的长按设置。"
